<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">SMALL HABITS, REAL PROGRESS</view>
  <view class="title">每一餐，都有记录。</view>
  <view class="row">
    <picker
      class="grow"
      range="{{periods}}"
      value="{{period}}"
      data-key="period"
      bindchange="change"
    >
      {{periods[period]}}
    </picker>
    <text class="small">集体视角</text>
    <switch
      checked="{{collective}}"
      data-key="collective"
      bindchange="change"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="grid">
    <view class="metric">
      <view class="number">¥{{report.paid||'0.00'}}</view>
      <text class="muted">实际支出</text>
    </view>
    <view class="metric">
      <view class="number">¥{{report.share||'0.00'}}</view>
      <text class="muted">按当前人数分摊</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="heading">热量与三大营养素</view>
    <text class="muted">仅统计已记录餐次，不代表全天完整摄入。</text>
    <view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">
      记录一餐后，这里会出现你的趋势。
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="date">
      <view class="row label">
        <text>{{item.date}}</text>
        <text>{{item.kcal}} kcal</text>
      </view>
      <view class="chartbar" style="width:{{item.width}}%" />
      <view class="muted">
        蛋白 {{item.protein}}g · 碳水 {{item.carbs}}g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}}g · 钙
        {{item.calcium}} · 铁 {{item.iron}} · 钠 {{item.sodium}} · 维C
        {{item.vitaminC}}
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{report.score!=null}}" class="heading">
      已记录餐次目标匹配度：{{report.score}} / 100
    </view>
    <view class="notice">{{report.score_note}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="row">
    <button class="grow" data-kind="meal" bindtap="photo">记录一餐</button>
    <button class="grow secondary" data-kind="receipt" bindtap="photo">
      小票识别
    </button>
  </view>
  <button class="secondary" bindtap="totalOnly">仅记录实际支付金额</button>
  <view class="heading">不可改写的实付账单</view>
  <view wx:for="{{receipts}}" wx:key="id" class="card row">
    <view>
      <view>{{item.purchased_on}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.items.length}} 项食材 · 实付金额</view>
    </view>
    <view class="heading">¥{{item.paid}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice">
    {{report.source}}。所有营养数值为食材数据库估算，不是实验室检测。
  </view>
</view>
